 "settings_in_gen3_the": "In Gen3 the PID and Individual Values share the same source (Method 1 random algorithm), so shiny, nature, Individual Values and gender cannot all hold at the same time. When they conflict, the program gives way step by step in the order below: items further up are kept first, items further down are sacrificed first.",
