 "settings_gender_derived_from": "· Gender: derived from the PID, the easiest to give up.",
 "settings_nature_in_gen3": "· Nature: in Gen3 the nature is determined by the PID (PID % 25), affecting stats and nature modifiers.",
 "settings_max_ivs_all": "· Max IVs: all 6 are set to 31 directly and take no part in the trade-off; a matching PID is then looked for, and the nature may change (the set of candidate natures for all-31 IVs is fixed).",
 "settings_reroll_pid_a": "· Reroll PID: a new PID is generated and the Individual Values change with it. Items listed before \"Individual Values\" in this list are kept (e.g. with Nature→Shiny→IV→Gender, nature and shiny are kept).",
